{
  "uid": "obs-reaper",
  "title": "維運 Job (reaper)",
  "tags": [
    "obs",
    "rev6-admin",
    "reaper"
  ],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "editable": false,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "30s",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "templating": {
    "list": []
  },
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "上次 execute 成功距今 (age)",
      "description": "time() - reaper_last_success_timestamp{mode=\"execute\"}；三 job（token-reap／audit-retention／policy-reconcile）各一序列、以 pushgateway grouping 標籤 reaper_job 區分（grouping key /metrics/job/reaper/reaper_job/<job>、每次完跑 PUT 整組替換）；值＝該 job 上次 execute 完跑至今秒數（告警⑤／⑥同錨：僅認 execute、dry-run 不算；⑦b 同門檻而不分 mode〔對賬之 --execute 只決定心跳 mode 標籤〕＝dry-run 排程下本面板無 policy-reconcile 序列而⑦b 照判；172800=2×86400、調 REAPER_INTERVAL_SECS 須同步）。pushgateway 無某 job 組（例：從未推過心跳、或該組已 DELETE）＝該序列缺席、三組皆無＝No data，屬預期。pushgateway 持久卷（docker-compose.yml pushgateway 段之 --persistence.file 與 pushgateway_data 卷）、重啟不失憶（rev4:FR-008）：jobs 停跑後末次序列仍在、值持續增長（逾 172800 告警轉紅）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 86400
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 172800
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "time() - reaper_last_success_timestamp{mode=\"execute\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{reaper_job}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "上次刪除列數 by mode (rows deleted)",
      "description": "reaper_deleted_total{mode=dry-run|execute}；token-reap 與 audit-retention 推本 metric（policy-reconcile 不推）、以 grouping 標籤 reaper_job 區分；dry-run＝候刪數、execute＝實刪數（audit-retention 之值＝四表合計）；gauge、每次完跑 PUT 整組替換。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "reaper_deleted_total",
          "legendFormat": "{{reaper_job}} {{mode}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "pushgateway up",
      "description": "up{job=\"pushgateway\"}；reaper 推 metric 的閘道健康。down=心跳接收端不可達。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "value",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=\"pushgateway\"}",
          "legendFormat": "pushgateway",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "刪除列數趨勢 by mode (rows deleted over time)",
      "description": "reaper_deleted_total{mode} 隨時間；token-reap 與 audit-retention 推本 metric（policy-reconcile 不推）、以 grouping 標籤 reaper_job 區分；dry-run＝候刪數、execute＝實刪數（audit-retention 之值＝四表合計）；gauge、每次完跑 PUT 整組替換。pushgateway 持久卷（docker-compose.yml pushgateway 段之 --persistence.file 與 pushgateway_data 卷）、重啟不失憶（rev4:FR-008、rev3 in-memory 形有意識偏離）。",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 7
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "showPoints": "always",
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none"
            }
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "sort": "none"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "reaper_deleted_total",
          "legendFormat": "{{reaper_job}} {{mode}}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
